Restore MAC runtime state and PHY events omitted by the imported procfs stub.

Expose cached status through seq_file, leave legacy debug writes unavailable,
disable OEM WAN-to-LAN mirroring and use the current PRNG/type interfaces.
Resource, QDMA and factory interfaces remain unresolved; no fallback stubs.

